::MCR_U03_L06_Quiz_Q01::
Question ID: MCR_U03_L06_Quiz_Q01
MLA Standard: Readiness Support Only - Extension of MLA.MCR.DL.9
Question:
Which response best supports this sampling skill: identify the population?
{
=A. Check the population, sample method, possible bias, and limits of the conclusion.#Correct. Sampling quality determines how far a conclusion can reasonably be generalized.
~B. Assume every sample represents the population.#A sample may be biased or too narrow to represent the population.
~C. Use only people who are easiest to reach.#A convenience sample can create bias and limit conclusions.
~D. Write a leading survey question.#Biased wording can influence answers and weaken the data.
}
